D-Mart Sales Analysis

This is my first data analysis project based on a D-Mart sales dataset. The Excel file includes details such as order information, product categories, regions, sales, and profit.

In this project, I performed basic data analysis to understand sales performance, identify trends, and compare results across different regions and categories. I also worked on data cleaning and organization to make the dataset ready for analysis.

Through this project, I developed a strong foundation in data understanding, basic analysis, and Excel skills, which are essential for real-world data analytics.
